<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>CUDA</title><link>https://jaehun.me/tags/cuda/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/tags/cuda/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>[논문리뷰] SageAttention3: Microscaling FP4 Attention for Inference and An Exploration of 8-bit Training</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-sageattention3-microscaling-fp4-attention-for-inference-and-an-exploration-of-8-bit-training/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/%EB%85%BC%EB%AC%B8%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0-sageattention3-microscaling-fp4-attention-for-inference-and-an-exploration-of-8-bit-training/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 09 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.11594v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 v1&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/html/2505.11594v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;원문&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="fp4-추론과-int8-학습을-구분하기"&gt;FP4 추론과 INT8 학습을 구분하기&lt;a href="#fp4-%ec%b6%94%eb%a1%a0%ea%b3%bc-int8-%ed%95%99%ec%8a%b5%ec%9d%84-%ea%b5%ac%eb%b6%84%ed%95%98%ea%b8%b0" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;SageAttention3는 &lt;strong&gt;FP4 추론&lt;/strong&gt;, SageBwd는 &lt;strong&gt;INT8 학습&lt;/strong&gt;을 다룹니다. 일곱 행렬곱은 순전파 두 개와 역전파 다섯 개이며, $dOV^\top$는 FP16으로 유지합니다. (§3–4)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>